CHILD SAFETY

This Software implements protections for minors: verifiable parental consent,
age gates that no subscription can purchase past, on-device-only rendering for
under-13 accounts, exclusion of minors from recordings, and an unconditional
panic exit.

These are not optional features, and this license grants no permission to
remove them. Any authorized deployment to real families remains responsible
for its own compliance with COPPA, GDPR/GDPR-K, the UK Age Appropriate Design
Code, and any other law applicable in its jurisdiction.
